{"id":"level-up-2026-09-24","name":"2026-09-24 每日卡片","project":"level-up-cards","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/aha-moment-art/level-up-cards/tree/5fe1e82100e36ff24691128b840751378978fb45","sentences":[{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-24:s301","en":"She will assume responsibility for the project next month.","zh":"她将于下个月接手负责这个项目。","note":"assume · 假定， 设想； 承担， 就 · assume responsibility","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-24:s302","en":"Add a little black pepper before serving the soup.","zh":"上汤前加一点黑胡椒。","note":"pepper · 胡椒；在…上撒 · black pepper","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-24:s303","en":"The young musician believed practice could help shape her destiny.","zh":"这位年轻音乐家相信练习能帮助塑造自己的命运。","note":"destiny · 命运， 定数 · shape one's destiny","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-24:s304","en":"His doctoral research examines how cities adapt to extreme heat.","zh":"他的博士研究探讨城市如何适应极端高温。","note":"doctoral · 博士的 · doctoral research","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-24:s305","en":"The teacher explained the concept using a simple drawing.","zh":"老师用一幅简单的图画解释了这个概念。","note":"concept · 概念， 观念； 设想 · a basic concept","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-24:s306","en":"Some staff were initially resistant to the new timetable.","zh":"一些员工最初对新课表抱有抵触情绪。","note":"resistant · 抵抗的， 有抵抗力的 · resistant to change","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-24:s307","en":"The exhibition explores how people celebrated the new millennium.","zh":"展览探讨了人们如何庆祝新千年的到来。","note":"millennium · 一千年， 千禧年； 太平盛世 · a new millennium","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-24:s308","en":"The empty shops presented a stark contrast to last summer.","zh":"空荡荡的商店与去年夏天形成了鲜明对比。","note":"stark · 光秃秃的， 赤裸的； 荒凉的； 完全的 · a stark contrast","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-24:s309","en":"The children stopped to stare at the enormous ice sculpture.","zh":"孩子们停下来，盯着那座巨大的冰雕看。","note":"stare · 盯 · stare at","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-24:s310","en":"The bicycle shop requires a refundable deposit for rentals.","zh":"自行车店租车时要求缴纳可退还的押金。","note":"refundable · 可退还的， 可归还的， 可偿还的 · a refundable deposit","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-24:s311","en":"Well-chosen illustrations can enhance learning in a science textbook.","zh":"精心选择的插图能增强科学教材的学习效果。","note":"enhance · 提高， 增强， 增进 · enhance learning","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-24:s312","en":"Hundreds of booksellers attended the annual convention in Manchester.","zh":"数百名书商参加了在曼彻斯特举行的年度大会。","note":"convention · 大会， 会议； 惯例， 常规， 习俗； 公约， 协定 · an annual convention","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-24:s313","en":"The nurse checked the label on the antiseptic solution.","zh":"护士核对了消毒液上的标签。","note":"antiseptic · 防腐的， · antiseptic solution","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-24:s314","en":"The chemistry class measured calcium levels in different water samples.","zh":"化学课上测量了不同水样中的钙含量。","note":"calcium · 钙 · contain calcium","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-24:s315","en":"His firm refusal left little room for further discussion.","zh":"他坚决拒绝，几乎没有留下继续讨论的余地。","note":"refusal · 拒绝 · a firm refusal","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-24:s316","en":"The school plans to purchase new equipment for the workshop.","zh":"学校计划为实训室购买新设备。","note":"purchase · 买，购买；购买的物品 · purchase equipment","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-24:s317","en":"We walked along the shore collecting smooth white stones.","zh":"我们沿着岸边散步，捡起光滑的白色石头。","note":"shore · 滨， 岸， 海滩 · along the shore","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-24:s318","en":"The shallow rock pools teem with tiny fish and crabs.","zh":"浅浅的岩石水洼里有许多小鱼和螃蟹。","note":"teem · 倾泻； 充满， 遍布 · teem with life","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-24:s319","en":"She found a stylish jacket in the secondhand shop.","zh":"她在二手店找到了一件时髦的夹克。","note":"stylish · 时髦的； 漂亮的 · a stylish jacket","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-24:s320","en":"The new road allows delivery trucks to bypass the town.","zh":"新路让送货卡车可以绕过镇子。","note":"bypass · 旁道；绕过 · bypass the town","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-24:s321","en":"The programme aims to give all applicants an equal opportunity.","zh":"这个项目旨在给所有申请者平等的机会。","note":"equal · 相等的；比得上 · equal opportunities","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-24:s322","en":"The optometrist asked me to read letters from a chart.","zh":"验光师让我读视力表上的字母。","note":"optometrist · 验光师， 视力测定者 · visit an optometrist","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-24:s323","en":"The display explains how a silicon chip processes information.","zh":"该展板解释了硅芯片如何处理信息。","note":"silicon · 硅 · a silicon chip","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-24:s324","en":"Local businesses agreed to fund repairs to the playground.","zh":"当地企业同意出资维修游乐场。","note":"fund · 基金，专款；储备，蕴藏；；为…提供资金， 给…拨款 · fund a project","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-24:s325","en":"The lesson explored how gravity affects objects falling towards Earth.","zh":"这节课探讨了重力如何影响落向地球的物体。","note":"gravity · 重力 · the force of gravity","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-24:s326","en":"The chair led the heated debate with moderation and patience.","zh":"主席以克制与耐心主持了这场激烈的辩论。","note":"moderation · 温和， 中庸； 适度， 合理 · with moderation","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-24:s327","en":"Each recipient of the award will give a short speech.","zh":"每位获奖者都将发表简短讲话。","note":"recipient · 接受者 · an award recipient","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-24:s328","en":"The lecture examined educational exchanges between members of the Commonwealth.","zh":"讲座研究了英联邦成员之间的教育交流。","note":"commonwealth · [the C-] 英联邦； 联合体 · the Commonwealth","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-24:s329","en":"The keeper described the small marsupial hiding inside the log.","zh":"饲养员介绍了藏在木头里的那只小型有袋动物。","note":"marsupial · 有袋动物 · a small marsupial","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-24:s330","en":"We watched a bright yellow bird alight on a branch.","zh":"我们看见一只鲜黄色的鸟落在枝头。","note":"alight · 燃烧的；〔鸟或虫等〕飞落 · alight on a branch","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-24:s331","en":"The reform sought to enfranchise adults previously excluded from elections.","zh":"这项改革旨在赋予此前被排除在选举之外的成年人投票权。","note":"enfranchise · 给予…政治权利； 解放 · enfranchise voters","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-24:s332","en":"They saved for years to finance the purchase of their café.","zh":"他们攒了多年钱，来支付购买咖啡馆的费用。","note":"finance · 为…提供资金；财政，金融； · finance a purchase","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-24:s333","en":"She likes to stash spare notebooks in her desk drawer.","zh":"她喜欢把备用笔记本藏在书桌抽屉里。","note":"stash · 藏匿； 贮藏 · stash away","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-24:s334","en":"Late changes to the design may incur additional printing costs.","zh":"临时修改设计可能产生额外的印刷费用。","note":"incur · 招致， 遭受 · incur additional costs","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-24:s335","en":"Readers began to inundate the author with requests for a sequel.","zh":"读者开始向作者提出大量续写的请求。","note":"inundate · 淹没， 泛滥； 使不胜负荷， 使应接不暇 · inundate with requests","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-24:s336","en":"The band spent the weekend in a small recording studio.","zh":"乐队在一间小录音室度过了周末。","note":"studio · 工作室； 摄影室； 练习室 · a recording studio","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-24:s337","en":"The greenhouse uses automatic vents to regulate its temperature.","zh":"温室利用自动通风口调节温度。","note":"regulate · 管制， 控制； 调节， 校准； 调整 · regulate temperature","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-24:s338","en":"The two designers bring complementary skills to the project.","zh":"两位设计师为项目带来了互补的技能。","note":"complementary · 互补的； 补充的， 补足的 · complementary skills","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-24:s339","en":"The diagram labels each sweat gland within the skin.","zh":"这张图标出了皮肤中的每个汗腺。","note":"gland · 腺 · a sweat gland","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-24:s340","en":"Excluding residents from planning decisions can disempower entire communities.","zh":"把居民排除在规划决策之外，可能削弱整个社区的影响力。","note":"disempower · 使失去权力或影响 · disempower communities","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-24:s341","en":"The course fee is payable in advance by bank transfer.","zh":"课程费用需要通过银行转账预先支付。","note":"payable · 可支付的； 应支付的 · payable in advance","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-24:s342","en":"The argument rests on the premise that transport remains affordable.","zh":"这个论证基于交通费用保持可负担这一前提。","note":"premise · 前提，假设； · a basic premise","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-24:s343","en":"Students discussed the suppression of public debate in the novel.","zh":"学生们讨论了小说中公共讨论遭到压制的情节。","note":"suppression · 镇压， 压制， 抑制； 扑灭 · the suppression of debate","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-24:s344","en":"The controversial proposal divided opinion at the town meeting.","zh":"这项有争议的提案在镇民会议上引发了意见分歧。","note":"controversial · 争论的 · a controversial proposal","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-24:s345","en":"You will receive a receipt after we process your payment.","zh":"我们处理付款后，你会收到收据。","note":"payment · 支付； 支付的款项 · make a payment","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-24:s346","en":"Regular practice helped her attain the required standard of performance.","zh":"经常练习帮助她达到了规定的表演水平。","note":"attain · 达到； 获得； 完成 · attain a goal","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-24:s347","en":"We need an unprejudiced assessment from someone outside the organisation.","zh":"我们需要机构外人士作出公正的评估。","note":"unprejudiced · 无偏见的； 公正的 · an unprejudiced assessment","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-24:s348","en":"The new tenant asked where to leave the recycling.","zh":"新房客询问可回收物应放在哪里。","note":"tenant · 承租人； 房客； 佃户 · a new tenant","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-24:s349","en":"